Package: dialogforgeruntime
Type: Package
Title: Shared R Runtime Support for DialogForge
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Adrian", "Dusa", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "dusa.adrian@unibuc.ro")
Description: Non-evaluating object and binding inspection, physical graphics
    device observation, scoped frontend console input, bounded runtime transport
    and ordered output capture for DialogForge. Native R and WebAssembly R build
    the same source files. Runtime policy and lifecycle remain caller owned.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
NeedsCompilation: yes
